    "show_share": true,
    "description": "For over a decade now, Pakistan has witnessed its fair share of natural calamities and man-made distresses: floods, terrorism, poverty, inflation. In the unstable political environment, governance has taken a beating, gender discrimination is rampant and the heathcare system left so fragile that it cannot adequately address the needs of the population.",
